date: 2026-05-17
purpose: RFC#45 chunks 4-7 lossless backport — A/B gate verification
corpus: gb82-sc (5 screenshots — chunks 4-7 baseline) + CID22-512 (5 photos)
config: LosslessConfig::new() vs .with_patches(false)
features: __internals
example: jxl-encoder/examples/patches_lossless_gate_ab.rs

verifies:
  1. Gate verdict matches empirical win sign across 10 measured cells.
  2. Post-wire-up bytes_on identical to pre-wire-up calibration TSV
     (gate fires TRUE on all 5 screenshots where patches were previously
     auto-admitted, gate fires FALSE on photos where detector returns
     None upstream).

results: 10 of 10 cells gate verdict == empirical win sign
  5 screenshots: gate=true,  empirical_win=true  (savings 1110-135091 B)
  5 photos:      gate=false, empirical_win=false (detector None, no patches)
